  "code": "let n = 3\nlet big = 3_000_000_000L\n\n// the narrower operand widens to the wider type\nlet half = n * 0.5\nlet total = n + big\nlet below = n < 3.5\n\n// the narrower of the reachable results: single\nlet scaled = big * 2.0s\n\n// equality doesn't widen: convert explicitly\nlet same = double(n) == 3.0\n\nwrite_line(\"{half} {total} {below} {scaled} {same}\")",
